      "math_academy_id": "e-21642",
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-8x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-8y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSketch the phase portrait of the linear system above.",
      "worked_solution": "Writing our system in matrix form, we have\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/9f27f467834a272523abd1e91917a54238ffc4285604ed23bb0ab586c9bddf18.svg)\nwhere ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/d7a208eb154465cafcf79d88ca68ea0ce6f5495d6ef8a5422067c0a715c8d5a9.svg)\n\nSince our system is decoupled, its eigenvalues are $\\lambda_1=\\lambda_2=-8$ with the corresponding eigenvectors $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/b065c2e7545263717e8fff80ae73e1da94e887dc71dede4f3ea407e7813235a6.svg)\n\nThe general solution of the system is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/62bde418f953d1b1fd5a1d6a6a86b906ff5d7d450df394659a7c4b7f05429a2b.svg)\n\nNotice that for each vector ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/801f700af75812fffd64e47af2b0fc9ef8f8d272db18b2313c2e559351f22294.svg) we get the straight-line solutions of the form\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/03267ffbf294f2c6f4e26f36c616eadd66e8fafdac840ffd8b6c67be9f0253c6.svg)\nthat represent the line passing through the origin and parallel to the vector ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/6384331f36cb9ba308dcf3596e9640b28aac22c8c539a750c6d697055d6de4cb.svg)\n\nSince $e^{-8t} \\to 0$ as $t \\to \\infty,$ these solutions approach the origin as $t \\to \\infty,$ so the origin is a stable node.\n\nThe phase portrait satisfying these conditions is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14124655/assets/4c337f7f6b80f340859844e8217525db98230660d22e760c70218f0c282d21e9.png)",
